Thu Nov  5 16:30:00 UTC 2026 - Denys <288736242+StDenis1980@users.noreply.github.com>

- New subpackage herkos-manifests: the catalogue of programs Gloxi may
  use (herkos/catalogue, ADR 0017 stage 2 step 7), first the five Tinta
  Office programs, with a vilna-mcp-ext-<name>@ unit for each
- A generic operation ("execute") takes the level of the commands it
  runs, from the manifest's [commands]; an unnamed command is R4
- Programs from Flatpak never get the printing socket; a program that
  takes no folders gets none

